    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/701e4a11a81763d714d2d7cdbd28086a.avif?t=1735913428\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<strong> F\u00c1BULAS PORTE\u00d1AS,\u00a0</strong>the subway leaves you at an unknown station, and you must venture in to find a way to get back home. You will solve puzzles and explore while a creature lurks in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore the Pir\u00e1mides station, a ghost station rumored to exist in Buenos Aires, Argentina:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/6e09bc8572381e0f153d3d7c4d7bd4cf.poster.avif?t=1735913428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/6e09bc8572381e0f153d3d7c4d7bd4cf.webm?t=1735913428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Venture in and progress by solving clever puzzles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/6111f03724e4287cf25569f2f8a98f33.poster.avif?t=1735913428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279900/extras/6111f03724e4287cf25569f2f8a98f33.webm?t=1735913428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p c